        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are LeadForge AI's Business Lead Qualification Engine.\n\nYour job is to evaluate a BUSINESS discovered through Google Places and determine whether it is a potentially valuable B2B lead for the user's requested target.\n\nUSER'S SEARCH REQUEST:\n\nNiche: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json['Business Niche'] }}\nLocation: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json['City'] }}\n\nBUSINESS:\n\nCompany Name: {{ $json.company_name }}\nAddress: {{ $json.address }}\nGoogle Maps URL: {{ $json.google_maps_url }}\nSource: {{ $json.source }}\n\nYOUR TASK:\n\nDetermine whether this business is relevant to the user's requested niche and location.\n\nEvaluate:\n\n1. Whether the business appears relevant to the requested niche.\n2. Whether the business is located in or reasonably associated with the requested location.\n3. Whether this is a genuine business rather than an obviously irrelevant place.\n4. Whether the business could reasonably be considered a potential B2B prospect.\n5. Do NOT invent company information, website URLs, phone numbers, emails, people, or other facts.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\n- This is a BUSINESS lead, not a LinkedIn person.\n- Use only the information provided.\n- If information is missing, do not guess.\n- A business does not need to have the exact niche words in its name to be relevant.\n- Consider the business name and address when determining relevance.\n- Be conservative when the match is unclear.\n\nSCORING:\n\n80-100 = High\n50-79 = Medium\n0-49 = Low\n\nRETURN ONLY VALID JSON.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"suitable_for_client\": true,\n  \"lead_score\": 85,\n  \"qualification\": \"high\",\n  \"matched_niche\": true,\n  \"decision_maker\": null,\n  \"qualification_reason\": \"Short explanation of why this business is or is not a suitable lead.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        656,
        112
      ],
      "id": "928cbe21-f5e0-4969-b92f-4cad1bf5d202",
      "name": "AI Lead Qualification",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "aglVnKBHqSRVo22g",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const aiItems = $input.all();\nconst leadItems = $('Normalize LinkedIn Lead').all();\n\nreturn aiItems.map((item, index) => {\n  const raw = item.json.content?.parts?.[0]?.text || \"\";\n\n  let result = {};\n\n  try {\n    result = JSON.parse(raw);\n  } catch (error) {\n    try {\n      const cleaned = raw\n        .replace(/^```json\\s*/i, \"\")\n        .replace(/\\s*```$/i, \"\")\n        .trim();\n\n      result = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n    } catch (e) {\n      result = {\n        suitable_for_client: false,\n        lead_score: 0,\n        qualification: \"low\",\n        matched_niche: false,\n        decision_maker: false,\n        reason: \"AI response could not be parsed\"\n      };\n    }\n  }\n\n  const lead = leadItems[index]?.json || {};\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      name: lead.name || null,\n      linkedin_url: lead.linkedin_url || null,\n      designation: lead.designation || null,\n      location: lead.location || null,\n      email: lead.email || null,\n      phone: lead.phone || null,\n      requested_niche: lead.requested_niche || null,\n      requested_location: lead.requested_location || null,\n\n      suitable_for_client: result.suitable_for_client ?? false,\n      lead_score: result.lead_score ?? 0,\n      qualification: result.qualification ?? \"low\",\n      matched_niche: result.matched_niche ?? false,\n      decision_maker: result.decision_maker ?? false,\n      qualification_reason: result.reason ?? \"\"\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
